  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving access to finance for Angolan agribusiness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will identify the potential in agricultural finance for the public Development Bank of Angola (BDA), a strategy to develop their activities targeting this sector and design a capacity building programme.The deliverable of the project is a strategic report on the interventions that will accelerate the development and performance of the BDA.Direct goal is to support the BDA in its ambition to grow its activities targeting food and agribusinesses in the coming years. The ultimate purpose of the project is to further develop the agricultural sector in Angola by improving access to finance for rural agricultural small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs).</narrative>
  </description>
